 "intuition": "Send light in from infinity and it collapses to $F_2$; reverse the arrows and light from $F_1$ leaves parallel. Both statements come from the same lens equation with $u\\to-\\infty$ or $v\\to\\infty$. Because the media are the same on both sides, the two focal lengths are equal and opposite in this sign convention.",
